abstract: >-
  Measured recipe for running the Gemma-4 26B mixture-of-experts model on a desktop CPU
  with no graphics card: about 40 tokens per second single-stream, lossless against plain
  Q4_0, and about 124 tokens per second aggregate at batch 32, on an i9-13900K with 64 GB
  of DDR5-4800. Includes the per-token byte budget, the measured memory bandwidth and
  roofline, the quantization recipe, the dead ends, and reproduce scripts against two
  pinned llama.cpp forks.
